# Phase 11 (2026-07-27 outer-search session): real-D20 short diagnosis run.
# algorithm=3 (Active Set) -- Phase 8's own D=4 finding: more robust to an untuned scaled
# trust-region radius than the default Interior/Direct (algorithm=1), which ran away
# catastrophically with the SAME scale set at D=4 (docs/key_results/
# melitz_phase8_d4_scaled_algorithm_comparison_2026-07-27.csv). maxit raised (this is a time-
# budgeted diagnosis run, not a quick maxit=25 regression check) and maxtime_real caps total
# wall-clock directly.
algorithm       3
eval_fcga       no
gradopt         exact
hessopt         2
feastol         1e-7
feastol_abs     1e-8
opttol          1e-3
opttol_abs      1e-4
maxit           2000
maxtime_real    480
outlev          3
honorbnds       always
